    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:qu3fj2ec4tf4diaxu46m57jm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtix7e5zc2l",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "AI researchers warn technology 'months away' from being able to connect to wifi using eduroam",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxtix7e5zc2l",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-14T12:04:06.145Z",
      "likes": 842,
      "replies": 16,
      "reposts": 216,
      "score": 8.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 3,
        "recency": 0.7,
        "age_hours": 54.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxxj65qhac2t",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "This paper shows why I am skeptical of the idea that frontier models can be easily replaced by cheaper ones (and why you should use the best models as orchestrators): Small improvements in accuracy & judgement compound over long-horizon tasks, creating huge gains in outcomes and reduction in errors.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxxj65qhac2t",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T02:18:38.285Z",
      "likes": 114,
      "replies": 11,
      "reposts": 12,
      "score": 7.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.2,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 16.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The sudden collapse of the value of Chain-of-Thought (even summarized CoT) in the agentic era changes working with AI.\n\nEffectively steering AIs and getting any sort of observability now requires you to ask for interim outputs & tests, and to use AI help to troubleshoot problems you find.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-15T15:35:23.276Z",
      "likes": 58,
      "replies": 5,
      "reposts": 4,
      "score": 6.2,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 26.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxxjezatj22t",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "You may save money in the short term, at the expense of worse work at the end. That doesn't mean small models can't do tons of valuable work, but you want to make sure they are orchestrated and error-checked by larger ones for many kinds of tasks.\n\nPaper: arxiv.org/pdf/2509.09677",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxxjezatj22t",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T02:22:28.461Z",
      "likes": 36,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 1,
      "score": 6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.6,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 16.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxx75uffbl2i",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Good news: there is a competitive US open-weight model\n\nBad news: it’s from Facebook",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxx75uffbl2i",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-15T23:19:31.029Z",
