      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Someone turned my blog post on the intuitions behind LLMs into a 8th grade instructional workbook and I'm just melting\n\nHere's the blog post: medium.com/@mark-riedl/...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxwifptyd22t",
